","ticker":"NVDA","time":"08:00","title":"NVDA: The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights Analog Devices, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing, Texas Instruments and NVIDIA","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/zacks-analyst-blog-highlights-analog-devices-taiwan-semiconductor-manufacturing-texas"},{"id":"us-b2a1664ee129","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Microsoft, SpaceX, Marvell Technology and Preformed Line Products showcase AI, cloud and infrastructure growth opportunities, but rising capital spending, execution risks and margin pressures challenge their outlooks.","ticker":"MRVL","time":"07:50","title":"MRVL: The Zacks Analyst Blog Highlights Microsoft, SpaceX, Marvell Technology and Preformed Line Products","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/zacks-analyst-blog-highlights-microsoft-spacex-marvell-technology-and-preformed-line"},{"id":"us-5560a64e5262","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Key PointsASML holds a global monopoly on the extreme ultraviolet lithography machines required to manufacture the most advanced microchips.","ticker":"ASML","time":"03:53","title":"ASML: ASML vs. Marvell Technology: Which Artificial Intelligence Stock Is a Better Buy Going into 2027?","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/asml-vs-marvell-technology-which-artificial-intelligence-stock-better-buy-going-2027"},{"id":"us-bdc8d37a4f08","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Key PointsMarvell agreed to buy Lumentum in an all-stock deal that puts Lumentum's enterprise value at $115 billion.","ticker":"AVGO","time":"02:43","title":"AVGO: Is Broadcom Stock a Buy After Marvell's $115 Billion Deal?","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/broadcom-stock-buy-after-marvells-115-billion-deal"},{"id":"us-ffb61ed372fd","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"While the initial post-election capitulation and rapid reversal signal a promising attempt to carve out a stock market bottom, investors should avoid mistaking a single-day rally for a guaranteed recovery.","ticker":"MRVL","time":"02:03","title":"MRVL: Is the Market Bottoming? 3 Tells to Watch","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/market-bottoming-3-tells-watch"},{"id":"us-825cf33f5a98","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Key PointsSpaceX is now an AI application investment.","ticker":"NVDA","time":"01:49","title":"NVDA: Here's What $10,000 Invested in SpaceX and Nvidia Could Be Worth by 2030","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/heres-what-10000-invested-spacex-and-nvidia-could-be-worth-2030"},{"id":"us-1ce5a8742bae","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Roughly 75% of S&P 500 members have reported results in the Q3 cycle, with earnings up +24.8% from the same period last year on +14.0% higher revenues. The Tech sector remains a strong contributor, as earnings for the sector are on pace to grow +44.2% year-over-year on +35.0% higher revenues.","ticker":"NVDA","time":"00:39","title":"NVDA: Q3 Earnings Scorecard: Solid Beats, Upward Revisions, and AI Drivers","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/q3-earnings-scorecard-solid-beats-upward-revisions-and-ai-drivers-0"},{"id":"us-8ad908eaa894","kind":"news","source":"Nasdaq.com (RSS)","text":"Roughly 75% of S&P 500 members have reported results in the Q3 cycle, with earnings up +24.8% from the same period last year on +14.0% higher revenues. The Tech sector remains a strong contributor, as earnings for the sector are on pace to grow +44.2% year-over-year on +35.0% higher revenues.","ticker":"NVDA","time":"00:35","title":"NVDA: Q3 Earnings Scorecard: Solid Beats, Upward Revisions, and AI Drivers","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/q3-earnings-scorecard-solid-beats-upward-revisions-and-ai-drivers"}],"date":"2026-11-05","via":"github-zbieracz"}